00:15:20.640 --> 00:15:23.770
<i>On the name of the stars!</i>

00:15:30.650 --> 00:15:37.160
<i>VEPPer, the twin stars 
blooming in the galaxy!</i>

00:15:37.160 --> 00:15:40.500
<i>Moon and sun, miracles and secrets</i>

00:15:38.890 --> 00:15:40.870
The twin stars shining in the heavens!

00:15:40.500 --> 00:15:43.840
<i>We're the stars making wishes come true!</i>

00:15:41.210 --> 00:15:42.500
Salty Sol!

00:15:42.860 --> 00:15:44.330
Melty Luna!

00:15:43.840 --> 00:15:50.290
<i>VEPPer, bringing a thrill 
to this blue planet!</i>

00:15:45.920 --> 00:15:48.800
Galaxy Idols, the VEPPer!

00:15:49.710 --> 00:15:51.170
Chosen warrior!

00:15:50.290 --> 00:15:53.760
<i>Let's illuminate the entire world!</i>

00:15:51.760 --> 00:15:53.130
Lucky you!

00:15:53.720 --> 00:15:55.100
Happy you!

00:15:53.760 --> 00:15:57.060
<i>On the name of the stars!</i>

00:15:56.350 --> 00:15:57.810
Shooting...

00:15:57.810 --> 00:15:58.520
Star!

00:16:06.100 --> 00:16:08.180
Hey! Look at me!

00:16:09.160 --> 00:16:10.310
What's that?

00:16:10.310 --> 00:16:12.030
A black volleyball?

00:16:12.610 --> 00:16:14.240
I may look black...

00:16:14.770 --> 00:16:17.240
But inside, I'm sparkling and shining!

00:16:17.760 --> 00:16:19.430
And my name...

00:16:19.430 --> 00:16:21.500
is Black Boba-yan Monster!

00:16:21.890 --> 00:16:23.420
Black Boba-yan?

00:16:23.420 --> 00:16:25.040
Look at me more!

00:16:25.040 --> 00:16:26.910
Receive my blackness!

00:16:26.910 --> 00:16:29.130
And polish me more!

00:16:29.840 --> 00:16:31.340
The black ball is coming at me!

00:16:31.540 --> 00:16:33.590
I am Muna! Kata!

00:16:33.590 --> 00:16:35.050
Boba-yan!

00:16:37.360 --> 00:16:38.940
Sky!

00:16:39.430 --> 00:16:41.200
I think something went flying.

00:16:41.200 --> 00:16:43.030
Looked like Munakata-san.

00:16:43.030 --> 00:16:44.500
Yumoto's right.

00:16:44.500 --> 00:16:48.440
Lots of things really do come flying
 and falling down in autumn.

00:16:48.960 --> 00:16:49.860
Yeah...

00:16:50.090 --> 00:16:52.740
Everyone, I think it's your turn!

00:16:55.600 --> 00:16:58.360
Yumoto, what's with the black ball?

00:16:58.360 --> 00:17:01.280
I think it's supposed to be a volleyball.

00:17:01.280 --> 00:17:04.080
Now, everyone! Love Making!

00:17:04.890 --> 00:17:06.530
Love Making!

00:17:32.540 --> 00:17:33.990
The Sparkling Prince!

00:17:35.150 --> 00:17:37.280
Battle Lover Scarlet!

00:17:38.060 --> 00:17:39.620
Love Making!

00:17:48.840 --> 00:17:50.090
The Flashing Prince!

00:17:50.570 --> 00:17:52.040
Battle Lover Cerulean!

00:17:53.310 --> 00:17:54.800
Love Making!

00:18:02.960 --> 00:18:04.340
The Piercing Prince!

00:18:04.820 --> 00:18:06.600
Battle Lover Epinard!

00:18:07.980 --> 00:18:09.300
Love Making!

00:18:17.850 --> 00:18:19.300
The Roaring Prince!

00:18:19.740 --> 00:18:21.440
Battle Lover Sulfur!

00:18:22.570 --> 00:18:24.020
Love Making!

00:18:32.650 --> 00:18:33.630
The Thrilling Prince!

00:18:34.570 --> 00:18:36.250
Battle Lover Vesta!

00:18:36.840 --> 00:18:40.550
This love-filled planet will 
not abide those who lack love!

00:18:40.700 --> 00:18:44.260
Those who wield loveless 
power must kneel before love!

00:18:44.530 --> 00:18:45.820
Love is power!

00:18:45.820 --> 00:18:47.480
Love is hope!

00:18:47.670 --> 00:18:49.060
Be born for love!

00:18:49.060 --> 00:18:50.940
Give your life for love!

00:18:50.940 --> 00:18:52.110
Love!

00:18:52.110 --> 00:18:54.880
We are, forever, the heirs 
to the throne of love...

00:18:55.220 --> 00:18:56.360
Battle Lovers!

00:18:56.730 --> 00:18:58.220
Feel the power...

00:18:58.580 --> 00:19:00.280
Of love!

00:19:01.610 --> 00:19:04.800
Black is the color that 
absorbs all other colors!

00:19:04.800 --> 00:19:09.290
My black ball will suck 
up all of your love power!

00:19:09.870 --> 00:19:12.580
Scarlet Love Lumiere!

00:19:12.940 --> 00:19:14.500
Cerulean Love Aqua!

00:19:16.460 --> 00:19:18.920
Epinard Love Hurricane!

00:19:19.170 --> 00:19:20.880
Sulfur Love Gaia!

00:19:21.130 --> 00:19:23.440
Vesta Love Ignit!

00:19:27.560 --> 00:19:30.770
What? He sucked in all of our attacks!

00:19:32.390 --> 00:19:34.720
I'm the invincible Black Boba-yan!

00:19:34.720 --> 00:19:36.480
Boing! Boing!

00:19:36.930 --> 00:19:38.890
He's bouncing around a lot.

00:19:38.890 --> 00:19:41.450
Yeah, I think he's having fun.

00:19:41.660 --> 00:19:42.680
Look!

00:19:42.680 --> 00:19:45.550
Inside this black sphere 
shines the greatest of gems,

00:19:45.550 --> 00:19:49.660
even harder than diamond, brighter 
than the first star of evening!

00:19:50.020 --> 00:19:52.870
Then why do you hide it?

00:19:55.270 --> 00:19:56.620
Because...

00:19:56.620 --> 00:19:59.040
he wouldn't polish me,

00:19:59.040 --> 00:20:01.220
so I gave up on shining.

00:20:01.570 --> 00:20:05.930
So you can't shine unless 
someone else polishes you?

00:20:07.210 --> 00:20:09.200
Instead of relying on someone else,

00:20:09.200 --> 00:20:10.880
you have to make yourself shine!

00:20:10.880 --> 00:20:14.650
Because you're a really 
beautiful diamond, right?

00:20:14.850 --> 00:20:16.860
W-Well...

00:20:17.200 --> 00:20:18.510
Don't worry!

00:20:18.510 --> 00:20:19.900
I know you can do it!

00:20:19.900 --> 00:20:21.320
You can shine!

00:20:21.500 --> 00:20:23.190
Even... I can?

00:20:23.190 --> 00:20:23.780
Yeah!

00:20:24.530 --> 00:20:26.950
Now, take this!

00:20:40.870 --> 00:20:44.840
True Love Attack!

00:20:54.350 --> 00:20:58.120
True Love Fountain!

00:21:08.890 --> 00:21:10.660
Love is over!

00:21:19.540 --> 00:21:21.830
Boy, am I glad!

00:21:22.100 --> 00:21:24.720
Shuzo-san is back with the volleyball club!

00:21:25.100 --> 00:21:29.100
"Shuzo! I was waiting for 
you to pull yourself up!"

00:21:29.390 --> 00:21:32.560
That's what the president 
said. He's as on-fire as ever!

00:21:32.560 --> 00:21:37.390
In the end, their little lovers' 
quarrel was the cause of it all.

00:21:37.390 --> 00:21:38.280
Yeah.

00:21:38.280 --> 00:21:39.990
It really put us through a lot.

00:21:39.990 --> 00:21:42.940
But what are you going to do about 
the volleyball club, Yumoto?

00:21:42.940 --> 00:21:44.410
I quit!

00:21:44.410 --> 00:21:47.140
After all, I'm in the Earth Defense Club!

00:21:47.140 --> 00:21:49.120
Yes! That's right!

00:21:49.660 --> 00:21:54.190
But with Oka Shuzo back, the 
club only has two members...

00:21:54.190 --> 00:21:57.420
Does that mean Munakata won't 
graduate this year, either?

00:21:57.420 --> 00:21:59.300
That's right!

00:21:59.300 --> 00:22:00.730
The president and Shuzo-san said

00:22:00.730 --> 00:22:03.840
they would continue their fiery training 
until they get into a tournament!

00:22:03.840 --> 00:22:05.670
They're totally fired up!

00:22:05.990 --> 00:22:08.660
Never going to graduate, huh?

00:22:09.080 --> 00:22:11.600
Two for Neverland, huh?

00:22:14.320 --> 00:22:18.600
Chicken was on sale today, 
so I made chicken hot pot.

00:22:18.600 --> 00:22:21.200
Come on, eat up, you two.

00:22:21.200 --> 00:22:23.730
It will warm up your cold hearts.

00:22:24.640 --> 00:22:26.020
Hakone...

00:22:26.020 --> 00:22:27.070
...Yumoto...

00:22:27.660 --> 00:22:29.880
We will make you pay!

00:24:00.890 --> 00:24:05.770
Everyone Loves Someone!

00:24:00.890 --> 00:24:05.770
<b>Next time:</b>

00:24:01.880 --> 00:24:04.270
Next time:  
Everyone Loves Someone!

00:24:04.270 --> 00:24:05.590
Love Making!
